    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/5795fff19800744ce935deaf4055cba8.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective\u00a0is simple, defend people being accused of murder and find the real killer... the only problem is\u00a0everyone involved in these murder cases are completely insane and helping you solve the case is the last thing on their mind, on top of that there is an mysterious organization conducting all these killings behind the scenes who will stop at nothing to make your job a living hell so it is your mission to expose take down and expose this mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/48df76782d9a1716dca4d54436870cc0.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The courtroom is a puzzle where you will be put to the test, analyse what the witnesses claim to have gone down on the night of the murder and prove them wrong<strong>,</strong> check your evidence and compare it with what there saying to see if there telling the truth, find contradictions and make objections to prove there lying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/511ef099231c206483658e168344c32a.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The courtroom has a long dark conspiracy hidden within that you have unknowingly been trapped in, slowly descend down its layers of lore and escape, <strong><i>watch your back</i></strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/7c850d73d71379719d8655ad91710bd7.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Four chapters.</strong> that\u00a0amounts to 10+ hours of gameplay over the course of\u00a0which the narrative gets increasingly more chaotic (also featuring a secret chapter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A huge cast of characters</strong>. all with unique personalities and\u00a0interconnecting backstories but beware... not all of them survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>The strongest character in fiction...</strong> Mr monkey<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/390377681489ca28c50d1141f9f8efd3.avif?t=1748799836\" width=800 height=1067 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he co wrote the game but doesn't know grammar and the difference between his theres, theirs and they're's so blame him for the bad grammar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/5795fff19800744ce935deaf4055cba8.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective\u00a0is simple, defend people being accused of murder and find the real killer... the only problem is\u00a0everyone involved in these murder cases are completely insane and helping you solve the case is the last thing on their mind, on top of that there is an mysterious organization conducting all these killings behind the scenes who will stop at nothing to make your job a living hell so it is your mission to expose take down and expose this mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/48df76782d9a1716dca4d54436870cc0.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The courtroom is a puzzle where you will be put to the test, analyse what the witnesses claim to have gone down on the night of the murder and prove them wrong<strong>,</strong> check your evidence and compare it with what there saying to see if there telling the truth, find contradictions and make objections to prove there lying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/511ef099231c206483658e168344c32a.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The courtroom has a long dark conspiracy hidden within that you have unknowingly been trapped in, slowly descend down its layers of lore and escape, <strong><i>watch your back</i></strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/7c850d73d71379719d8655ad91710bd7.avif?t=1748799836\" data-has-big width=800 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Four chapters.</strong> that\u00a0amounts to 10+ hours of gameplay over the course of\u00a0which the narrative gets increasingly more chaotic (also featuring a secret chapter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>A huge cast of characters</strong>. all with unique personalities and\u00a0interconnecting backstories but beware... not all of them survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>The strongest character in fiction...</strong> Mr monkey<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405670/extras/390377681489ca28c50d1141f9f8efd3.avif?t=1748799836\" width=800 height=1067 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he co wrote the game but doesn't know grammar and the difference between his theres, theirs and they're's so blame him for the bad grammar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
